# Weddy [Project Link](https://github.com/user/weddy-back)
## Backend server for wedding preparation web service
### Service: https://weddy-example.vercel.app/
### Swagger: https://weddy-example.pe.kr/swagger-ui/index.html
### Tech Stack: EC2, S3, Java, Spring Boot, MyBatis, MySql, Gradle, Mockito, JUnit
 - ERD design
 - CRUD and filtering API implementation
 - API documentation
 - Infrastructure setup
 - Test writing
### Solved Problem: Work distribution using Java interfaces
 - Need to implement CRUD API for two resources
 - Expected to use service logic for other resources not yet implemented
 - Tight schedule required work distribution
 - Discussed service logic interfaces first
 - Used predefined interfaces when other resource logic was needed
 - Used fixture data for return values until merge

# Freesize [Project Link](https://github.com/user/freesize)
## Backend server for image preprocessing web service for LoRA training
### Service: https://freesize-example.vercel.app/
### Tech Stack: EC2, S3, Java, Spring Boot, WebClient, Gradle, JUnit
 - Polling-based image processing API implementation
 - S3 file upload feature implementation
 - Infrastructure setup
### Solved Problem: Thread blocking issue
 - Server not responding when multiple requests sent at once
 - Issue occurred after external API calls
 - Checked thread state with thread dump and visualvm tool
 - Thread remained in WAITING state when certain number of requests exceeded
 - WAITING thread was blocking other threads
 - Problem was related to WebClient library thread for external API calls
 - Solved by changing from synchronous to asynchronous API calls
